  <item>
    <title>50. 改命的真正入口：从“被命运玩弄&quot;到&quot;体验命运&quot;</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a3a49079d2f5743683c82c2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a3a49079d2f5743683c82c2</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 23 Jun 2026 08:53:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们总以为改命是把坏命变好，求一个更高的力量放过自己。真相是这样吗？</span></p><p><span>这一期不讲术，换一个底层视角：借模拟假说把世界看成一场游戏，命就是你进场前自己捏的那套设定。那么改命到底是什么？</span></p><p><span>后半段分享我自己的三个实修尝试，并重新理解"一命二运三风水"那套改命方法。</span></p><h2><strong><span>⏱️ 时间轴</span></strong></h2><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1">00:01</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;开场：为什么今天再聊“改命”</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;拆解改命背后的三个隐藏假设</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="267">04:27</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;世界是真实的吗？</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="458">07:38</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;谁是真正的“我”？</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="613">10:13</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;命不是老天定的，是你进场前自己选的设定</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">12:13</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;三个练习：观察、承认、放下</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1058">17:38</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;传统方法与玩家视角，一内一外缺一不可</span></p><p><strong><span>🌟 关于一命二运三风水相关术数请参考往期节目：</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67166ec4db2cf82757e54533" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67166ec4db2cf82757e54533"><strong><span>28. 逆天改命有多难？</span></strong></a></p><p><strong><span>🌟 节目中提到到关于模拟假说的播客：</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://startalkmedia.com/show/cosmic-queries-living-in-a-simulation-with-nick-bostrom/" data-url="https://startalkmedia.com/show/cosmic-queries-living-in-a-simulation-with-nick-bostrom/"><span>Cosmic Queries – Living in a Simulation with Nick Bostrom</span></a></p><p><strong><span>🌟 本期主播：</span></strong></p><p><span>欣陶，投资人、奇门遁甲和杨公风水传承人，走过20多个国家，看过1000多个企业和创始人，不断在生活和商业世界中实践传统智慧。</span></p><p><span>加听友群、咨询请加 </span><strong><span>saiboxiudao</span></strong><span> 请注明来意。</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
