  <item>
    <title>48. 好人下地狱</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a0745041b7bd502953afb26</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a0745041b7bd502953afb26</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 16:30:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你是否也曾陷入“烂好人”的怪圈？明明已经心力交瘁，却无法对别人说出那个“不”字。这一期，我们撕开“好人”标签下的隐秘伤口，一层层拆解那份说不出口的委屈和愤怒到底从何而来。</span></p><p><span>我们会发现，那份单方面签署的“道德合同”、那份向内攻击的自责，以及隐藏在受害者身份下的“道德优越感”，如何一步步将我们拖入亲手建造的“地狱”。</span></p><p><span>我们会从佛家、道家、基督教和中国民间传说四个视角，重新理解“地狱”的本质。</span></p><p><span>最后，我们聊聊如何为自己“刑满释放”：练习一份带着觉知的诚实，建立有边界的善良，并勇敢经历“小我”死亡的阵痛。</span></p><h3><em><span>时间轴</span></em></h3><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;烂好人的委屈</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;好人痛苦的三层拆解：隐形合同、自我攻击、道德优越感</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="347">05:47</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;佛家看地狱</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="562">09:22</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;道家看地狱</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="689">11:29</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;基督教看地狱</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="893">14:53</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;民间传说看地狱</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1023">17:03</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;出口一：做真人</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1076">17:56</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;出口二：建边界</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1244">20:44</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;出口三：经历“小我”死亡的阵痛</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1426">23:46</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;做一个很难搞的人，活出真实的自己</span></p><p><span>如果你喜欢这期节目，欢迎评论、转发和点赞，这会对我非常有帮助！❤️</span></p><p><span>想要加入听友群或有咨询、课程需求，请添加微信saiboxiudao</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
