    <pubDate>Fri, 17 Apr 2026 06:06:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>九星是天性，八神是规律。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期聊八门——奇门遁甲里最落地的一组符号。它像一份关系说明书，能帮你读懂自己和他人：你习惯怎么做事、怎么和人相处、有什么需要留意的功课。听完可以打开命盘，看看你的命宫是哪扇门。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>⏲️ 时间轴</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> 九星与八神回顾</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="116">01:56</a> 八门是什么</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="158">02:38</a> 如何找命宫</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">04:18</a> 休门</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">06:21</a> 生门</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">08:08</a> 伤门</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">09:50</a> 杜门</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="674">11:14</a> 景门</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="753">12:33</a> 死门</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="849">14:09</a> 惊门</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="946">15:46</a> 开门</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1018">16:58</a> 组合思路</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>往期链接🔗</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/665ade7863c334a2fb99220a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/665ade7863c334a2fb99220a"><span>16. 请接收宇宙给你发来的人生说明书【奇门遁甲】</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66743722b6a84127292e8bc4" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66743722b6a84127292e8bc4"><span>18. 奇门遁甲，咱中国人自己的“MBTI”</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66b1f3a1e0957daebd48f5e6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66b1f3a1e0957daebd48f5e6"><span>24. 奇门遁甲吉星高照，活出最好的自己</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>交流及加听友群，请加微信saiboxiudao 注明来意。</span></p><span></span><p><span>排盘、找命宫、解读、进一步学习等问题可以评论区/微信交流。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢支持❤️</span></p>]]></description>
