  <item>
    <title>43. 八字解心结：停止内耗，看见彼此的能量系统</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/698b5834a22480add69177e6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">698b5834a22480add69177e6</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Feb 2026 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>道友们好！</span></p><span></span><p><span>丙午年第一期节目，跟大家分享如何从八字的两套核心系统——十神与五行——切入，从根本上理解人际关系中的摩擦与心结。</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目探讨为何我们总陷入“对错”之争，以及如何通过识别自身与他人的能量结构，实现真正的接纳与放下。不谈空泛的“看开”，只提供可实践的认知工具。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>⏲️ 时间轴</span></strong><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a></span></strong><span> 为何执着对错：人人都有自己的道理</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="351">05:51</a></span></strong><span> 八字两大系统：十神与五行</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="474">07:54</a></span></strong><span> 详解十神系统核心逻辑</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="729">12:09</a></span></strong><span> 案例：印旺与食伤旺的系统冲突</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="926">15:26</a></span></strong><span> 看懂系统、接纳自己</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a></span></strong><span> 讲解五行能量与生克</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1171">19:31</a></span></strong><span> 五行如何细化十神表现</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1419">23:39</a></span></strong><span> 心法：理解程序、及时止损、回归自身</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a></span></strong><span> 认识自己，方能放下</span></p><span></span><p><span>为了感谢大家的陪伴，本期节目会在留言区随机抽出3名道友送上神秘小礼物，欢迎大家参与。</span></p><span></span><p><span>交流、咨询、加听友群请加微信 saiboxiudao &nbsp;请注明来意。</span></p>]]></description>
